          "name": "Target",
          "type": "SparseLU*"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "SparseLUMatrixLReturnType<SCMatrix>",
      "docs": "\\returns an expression of the matrix L, internally stored as supernodes\nThe only operation available with this expression is the triangular solve\n\\code\ny = b; matrixL().solveInPlace(y);\n\\endcode"
    },
